# GhostNet Next-Gen Infrastructure Landing Page

I have designed and implemented a premium, "cyber infrastructure meets AI startup" landing page for **GhostNet**. The design is inspired by modern tech leaders like Vercel, Linear, and Stripe, utilizing deep blacks, neon blue/purple gradients, and glassmorphism.

## 🚀 Key Features
- **Cyber-Futuristic UI**: A dark mode interface with neon blue and electric purple highlights.
- **Glassmorphism Design**: High-end panels with backdrop blur and subtle glowing borders.
- **Premium Visuals**: Custom-generated 3D network visualizations and gradient mesh backgrounds.
- **Interactive Elements**: Smooth reveal animations, hover-triggered glow effects, and animated metric counters.
- **Responsive Layout**: Built with a modern grid system that scales beautifully across devices.

## 📁 Project Structure
The project is located at `c:\Users\novtw\Pictures\ghostnet-nextgen\`.
- [index.html](file:///c:/Users/novtw/Pictures/ghostnet-nextgen/index.html): The core structure using semantic HTML and Lucide icons.
- [index.css](file:///c:/Users/novtw/Pictures/ghostnet-nextgen/index.css): The design system including variables, glassmorphism tokens, and animations.
- [script.js](file:///c:/Users/novtw/Pictures/ghostnet-nextgen/script.js): Interaction logic for reveal animations and metric counters.
- `ghostnet_hero_visual.png`: AI-generated 3D network hero asset.
- `ghostnet_bg_mesh.png`: AI-generated abstract gradient mesh background.

